@startuml
actor "Attacker" as X
participant "Compromised App" as APP
participant "Token Service" as TS
participant "Risk Engine" as RISK
participant "API Gateway" as API
participant "SOC" as SOC
participant "SOAR" as SOAR

X -> APP: Steal refresh token
X -> API: Replay stolen token
API -> TS: Introspect token
TS --> API: Token valid (initially)
API -> RISK: Request continuous risk score
RISK --> API: High anomaly (impossible travel + device mismatch)
API -> SOC: Emit critical alert
SOC -> SOAR: Start token compromise workflow
SOAR -> TS: Revoke token family + signing keys rotation check
SOAR -> API: Block user/session pair
SOAR -> APP: Force re-auth (phishing-resistant MFA)
SOC -> SOAR: Validate no further abuse
@enduml
